{
 "_note": "Pixel rectangles per screenshot family for systems/duolingo. Coordinates only; no private text. Learner and owner names are painted by the OCR net, which reads patterns from files outside the repo; the rectangles below cover the leaderboard name columns and the browser status bar that shows a profile link on hover, where OCR alone misses rows.",
